They came in three different waves and not all at once,

271
00:14:19,866 --> 00:14:22,166
that the 14 people that were at the kibbutz,

272
00:14:22,166 --> 00:14:26,666
even though 11 of them were very trained soldiers,

273
00:14:27,366 --> 00:14:29,666
of course they couldn’t defeat them.

274
00:14:30,233 --> 00:14:33,966
The gap in the numbers is unbelievable,

275
00:14:34,166 --> 00:14:37,300
but what they could do was slow them down,

276
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:41,200
and harass them. And every time someone called for help,

277
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:44,666
they just used to go there and drive them away,

278
00:14:44,666 --> 00:14:46,133
scare them away.

279
00:14:46,666 --> 00:14:48,566
They managed to kill many of them,

280
00:14:48,566 --> 00:14:50,633
but they didn’t,

281
00:14:50,633 --> 00:14:52,100
they of course couldn’t,

282
00:14:53,566 --> 00:14:54,666
defeat them.

283
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:59,600
So what they did was that they held this place until

284
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:04,800
more reinforcement came around

285
00:15:05,033 --> 00:15:09,300
01:15 afternoon,

286
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:14,200
01:15 pm, they came,

287
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:17,866
there came more forces inside the kibbutz,

288
00:15:18,433 --> 00:15:21,400
and they helped

289
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:24,800
the people from here to fight the battle.

290
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:34,633
The second wave of terrorists

291
00:15:34,633 --> 00:15:36,700
came through the front gates of the kibbutz,

292
00:15:36,700 --> 00:15:38,933
which is closer to where I live,

293
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,966
and they split to two.

294
00:15:42,100 --> 00:15:44,366
One went straight towards my house,

295
00:15:44,366 --> 00:15:46,633
and the other one went

296
00:15:46,633 --> 00:15:47,700
right.

297
00:15:48,100 --> 00:15:49,766
There was a row of houses,

298
00:15:49,766 --> 00:15:53,300
the first row of houses right next to the front gate,

299
00:15:54,066 --> 00:15:56,400
and they started the massacre journey

300
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:59,300
throughout those houses.

301
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:03,533
At that time I'm sitting with my children and my family,

302
00:16:04,266 --> 00:16:07,933
and I see my husband, he sat

303
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:10,900
with a laptop and he turns it on,

304
00:16:10,900 --> 00:16:13,400
and I see him turn completely pale,

305
00:16:14,366 --> 00:16:16,800
and he signals me quietly,

306
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:19,066
so the children will not be bothered,

307
00:16:19,366 --> 00:16:23,133
and what we see is unbelievable.

308
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:26,533
Hamas had the GoPro cameras,

309
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:30,200
so not only they filmed the entire thing,

310
00:16:30,366 --> 00:16:33,533
they live streamed it. And not only that,

311
00:16:33,700 --> 00:16:37,066
they live streamed it on the same families'

312
00:16:37,833 --> 00:16:39,433
social media.

313
00:16:39,433 --> 00:16:42,633
The families that they were just capturing, torturing,

314
00:16:42,633 --> 00:16:43,933
murdering whatever.

315
00:16:44,366 --> 00:16:47,033
They put it on their social media,

316
00:16:47,033 --> 00:16:51,600
so their friends and families could see it real time,

317
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:52,933
What is happening to them.

318
00:16:53,766 --> 00:16:55,866
Which is really,

319
00:16:56,633 --> 00:16:57,466
really,

320
00:16:58,700 --> 00:17:01,400
A sick idea.

321
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:05,766
I was a few houses from there and I see

322
00:17:05,766 --> 00:17:07,766
my neighbors and friends,

323
00:17:08,233 --> 00:17:12,600
the first video we see is of the Elyakim-Arava family,

324
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:15,600
I'm not sure which one I saw first but...

325
00:17:16,066 --> 00:17:17,933
And we see that

326
00:17:19,066 --> 00:17:21,500
the family sits down looks terrorized,

327
00:17:21,500 --> 00:17:25,266
they were all around them terrorists,

328
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:27,066
they had three children there.

329
00:17:27,066 --> 00:17:30,800
One 8 years old one 15 years old and one 17.

330
00:17:31,566 --> 00:17:34,066
Two girls,

331
00:17:34,066 --> 00:17:35,866
and the 17 year old guy.

332
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:42,533
And what Hamas did was take the 17 year old,

333
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:44,066
Tomer Arava Eliaz,

334
00:17:45,833 --> 00:17:47,933
A brave, brave young man,

335
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:51,300
they put a gun to his head,

336
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:54,066
and they told him to go around houses,

337
00:17:54,066 --> 00:17:57,100
knocking on doors, telling people to get out.

338
00:17:57,900 --> 00:18:00,433
Now he was a very brave young man,

339
00:18:00,433 --> 00:18:03,066
and we know for a fact that

340
00:18:03,066 --> 00:18:05,400
by the ability of knowing

341
00:18:05,633 --> 00:18:06,666
the surroundings,

342
00:18:06,666 --> 00:18:09,966
he managed to save a few families.

343
00:18:09,966 --> 00:18:13,666
He was just honored by the president of Israel,

344
00:18:14,366 --> 00:18:16,766
his memory was honored.

345
00:18:19,866 --> 00:18:21,700
At a certain point,

346
00:18:21,900 --> 00:18:27,100
he ran away from Hamas, he tried running away,

347
00:18:27,366 --> 00:18:31,366
his body was found not far from the front gate,

348
00:18:32,300 --> 00:18:36,800
we don’t know how exactly he died, but he died.

349
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:41,566
The other members of the family,

350
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:45,766
the father's body was found in the outskirts of Gaza.

351
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:51,800
The mother and the two girls she was holding,

352
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:53,800
according to the girl's testimony,

353
00:18:54,266 --> 00:18:57,500
she was holding them in both hands,

354
00:18:57,666 --> 00:18:59,900
telling them not to be worried or afraid,

355
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:02,400
because they're together and she's going to protect them,

356
00:19:02,766 --> 00:19:04,400
and...

357
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:08,300
that second she gets shot in the head.

358
00:19:09,833 --> 00:19:13,600
And, the two girls one 8 years old and one 15,

359
00:19:13,833 --> 00:19:17,800
are taken to Gaza as hostages,

360
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:19,933
after seeing their entire family...

361
00:19:21,233 --> 00:19:22,033
die...

362
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:25,400
And they are staying there,

363
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:26,800
for two months,

364
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:28,400
until the second hostage deal.

365
00:19:31,166 --> 00:19:33,566
They didn’t come back in a good shape,

366
00:19:33,566 --> 00:19:34,700
to say the least.

367
00:19:35,866 --> 00:19:37,766
The second

368
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:42,866
Video that we see is of the Idan family.

369
00:19:42,900 --> 00:19:45,333
We see again the family sitting on the floor.

370
00:19:45,700 --> 00:19:47,533
Again, we see the father wounded,

371
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:48,900
we think that he is wounded,

372
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:51,166
but we realized later on

373
00:19:51,166 --> 00:19:53,000
that it was the blood of his daughter.

374
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:56,300
Of his 18 year old daughter

375
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:58,800
that was murdered right next to him,

376
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:01,466
when she tried helping him protect,

377
00:20:01,466 --> 00:20:03,600
guard the door of the safe room.

378
00:20:05,066 --> 00:20:06,866
We can hear the brother asking,

379
00:20:06,866 --> 00:20:08,266
"but why did you kill her?"

380
00:20:08,266 --> 00:20:10,066
"She was just a child",

381
00:20:10,066 --> 00:20:12,400
and we didn’t know which of his sisters

382
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:13,900
he was referring to.

383
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:19,866
It’s a certain point,

384
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:25,133
when Tomer Arava walked

385
00:20:25,766 --> 00:20:28,933
with the terrorists, he reached

386
00:20:28,933 --> 00:20:30,766
another neighborhood

387
00:20:30,766 --> 00:20:33,000
and he knocked on the doors over there,

388
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:36,166
and he said to many of the people

389
00:20:36,166 --> 00:20:38,166
"Don’t come out".

390
00:20:38,766 --> 00:20:40,300
And then,

391
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:43,200
one of the houses that he knocked on,

392
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:46,466
there was Omri and Lishay Miran,

393
00:20:47,066 --> 00:20:49,966
and they are such good spirits,

394
00:20:49,966 --> 00:20:53,866
good souls, that they couldn’t hear a 17 year old,

395
00:20:53,866 --> 00:20:57,600
in that situation. They were with a baby and a toddler,

396
00:20:57,900 --> 00:21:01,433
and they decided to put their knives down,

397
00:21:01,433 --> 00:21:02,800
and open the door.

398
00:21:05,433 --> 00:21:06,500
They were taken,

399
00:21:06,833 --> 00:21:09,700
and put with the Idan family in the same house,

400
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:12,866
and suddenly we see on the video,

401
00:21:12,866 --> 00:21:17,566
we see the Idan family also,

402
00:21:24,166 --> 00:21:24,966
Wow...

403
00:21:26,900 --> 00:21:28,366
And...

404
00:21:30,700 --> 00:21:32,866
What happens there is that...

405
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:36,966
There wasn't a pattern of who they take,

406
00:21:36,966 --> 00:21:38,566
and what they do.

407
00:21:38,566 --> 00:21:40,266
Every scenario was different.

408
00:21:40,633 --> 00:21:44,400
So in this case they decided to take only the two men.

409
00:21:45,833 --> 00:21:48,700
Omri Miran and Tsachi Idan, the two fathers.

410
00:21:49,366 --> 00:21:52,066
They took them to Gaza Strip.

411
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:59,200
We know today that Tsachi was dead since December 2023, probably.

412
00:21:59,833 --> 00:22:02,600
But since then,

413
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:04,200
we got so many different

414
